  "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(harness): sweep the published versions with cargo xtask sweep by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/197\n* feat(harness): soak a real tree read-only with cargo xtask soak by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/196\n* fix(runtime): keep the live map when a deletion finishes during the first scan by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/199\n* test(harness): keep the delete-during-scan fixture within 250,000 entries by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/200\n* perf(deletion): show that a removed file left no link on macOS by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/201\n* fix(runtime): take first-scan removals out of the first map by overlay by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/202\n* fix(ui): keep a removed entry off the map until the map without it arrives by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/204\n* test(harness): read the soak's screen after the paint where the terminal paints on its own timer by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/205\n* test(harness): look at the map while the first scan runs after a deletion by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/206\n* chore(release): prepare 1.4.1 by @findyourexit in https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/pull/203\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/findyourexit/excise/compare/v1.4.0...v1.4.1",
